<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Merchant Shipping (Amendment) Act 2017."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (3), this Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/eng@> .
